WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.727
Mom: We’ve looked everywhere.

2
00:00:04.728 --> 00:00:08.287
Guard: Maybe we should call the police.

3
00:00:08.288 --> 00:00:15.493
Ricky: The police? Oh, this is terrible.

4
00:00:15.494 --> 00:00:23.915
Man: Excuse me. Are you looking for a lost child?

5
00:00:23.916 --> 00:00:26.780
Ricky: Yes, my sister Rachel.

6
00:00:26.781 --> 00:00:30.350
Man: I think I know where she is.

7
00:00:30.351 --> 00:00:35.942
Ricky: Mom! This man knows where Rachel is!

8
00:00:35.943 --> 00:00:40.809
Man: Just follow

9
00:00:40.810 --> 00:00:46.250
me. I was looking at some books for my grandchildren.

10
00:00:46.251 --> 00:00:54.379
Mom: Rachel loves books.

11
00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:58.210
Ricky: Rachel! There you are!

12
00:00:58.211 --> 00:01:04.004
Rachel: Is it time to go?

13
00:01:04.005 --> 00:01:07.639
Mom: Thank you so much for your help.

14
00:01:07.640 --> 00:01:10.170
Man: Don’t mention it.

15
00:01:10.171 --> 00:01:14.887
Rachel: Mom? Are you crying?

16
00:01:14.888 --> 00:01:19.965
Mom: I’m just happy that you’re safe.

